      "name": null,
      "username": "Vim",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/b4bc9f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2021-04-24T21:52:18.708Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/+1.png?v=9\" title=\":+1:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":+1:\"></p>\n<p>The thing with some of the energy control powers is that a few have broad applications that could probably duplicate another power to a certain extent. I know invisibility and illusion are in other power groups but cosmic energy is linked to solar activity so I couldn’t help but wonder exactly what cosmic energy power could actually do.</p>\n<p>Edit: to be clear solar energy and light is linked to mirage and thus illusion.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-04-24T22:02:32.150Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 3,
