      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Thank you! 👍\n\nThe thing with some of the energy control powers is that a few have broad applications that could probably duplicate another power to a certain extent. I know invisibility and illusion are in other power groups but cosmic energy is linked to solar activity so I couldn't help but wonder exactly what cosmic energy power could actually do.\n\nEdit: to be clear solar energy and light is linked to mirage and thus illusion.",
