      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "I put it this way to my players.\n\nPowers/Qualities can do any of the basic actions.  Just think about what the end result is.  If you're using cosmic power to damage or to distract or whatever.  Basic actions cover everything pretty well.\n\nAbilities are specific ways in which your character breaks the rules - using Max die, doing two things at once, affecting multiple people etc.\n\nOnce players grasp that central concept - that you don't need an \"attack\" power to attack etc. everything moves so much smoother.",
